###Connection
RelationalDatabaseConnection test::azurearboretum::TreeConnection
{
  store: test::azurearboretum::ArboretumDb;
  type: H2;
  specification: LocalH2 {testDataSetupSqls: [];};
  auth: DefaultH2;
}

###Runtime
Runtime test::azurearboretum::TreeRuntime
{
  mappings: [test::azurearboretum::TreeMapping, test::azurearboretum::ReviewMapping];
  connections: [test::azurearboretum::ArboretumDb: [trees: test::azurearboretum::TreeConnection]];
}
